A whole new set was thrown up.
一套全新的组合被抛出。

00:52:46.869 --> 00:52:51.789
And sometimes you'd be leaving and they'd already be breaking down the set.
有时你要离开，他们已经把布景拆散了。

00:52:51.789 --> 00:52:54.989
You just shot in like 12 minutes earlier.
你大约 12 分钟前刚刚射门。

00:52:54.989 --> 00:52:58.829
Like I hope we got that scene because that thing is getting torn the half apart.
就像我希望我们能看到那个场景，因为那东西被撕成了两半。

00:52:58.829 --> 00:53:00.829
It's unbelievable, yeah.
真是令人难以置信，是的。

00:53:00.829 --> 00:53:03.829
Yeah, yeah, your whole team, Steve, was amazing.
是的，是的，你的整个团队，史蒂夫，都很棒。

00:53:03.829 --> 00:53:05.829
All the accolades were well deserved.
所有的荣誉都是当之无愧的。

00:53:05.829 --> 00:53:08.829
And shout out to Steve's kids who loved the show.
并向喜欢这个节目的史蒂夫的孩子们大声喊叫。

00:53:08.829 --> 00:53:09.829
Yeah, thanks.
是的，谢谢。

00:53:09.829 --> 00:53:10.829
We're happier.
我们更快乐了。

00:53:10.829 --> 00:53:12.829
Appreciate your dad's work.
欣赏你爸爸的工作。

